SUMMARY:In The Other Room: Jeffrey Keller
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:Jeffrey Keller is a stand-up comedian based out of New York Cit
 y known for his sharp wit\, boyish charm\, and a unique blend of humor that
  draws from his background in musical theatre. Jeffrey brings a hammy edge 
 to his stand-up\, blending storytelling with impeccable timing. As a straig
 ht man with an eclectic mix of mainly gay theatre friends\, he offers a per
 spective that’s both fresh and relatable. Despite his punchable face and 
 mullet\, it’s his big smile and infectious energy that win over audiences
  every time.\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, wh
 ich can be fulfilled with any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE 
 NOTE: Food and drinks purchased in the bar and lounge do not count towards 
 the two-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers
  from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other 
 patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/in-the-othe
 r-room-jeffrey-keller-21937/
